5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current system is failing. We need a sustainable structure for the next year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the time commitment. We need to understand the actual workload.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current distribution feels uneven. We should look at usage patterns before deciding.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. We need consistency.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want us to remain on good terms. Let's find a solution that works for everyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, valid point. Time is a resource we must account for.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, agreed. I will look into the timing of a full clean.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, consistency is key. I will check the calendar for absences.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, yes. I will look at what counts as done to set standards.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will check the previous tenants' note to see what worked for them.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I need to know the costs. I will check the receipts for supplies.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the management office rates for external help.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
