35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over an hour. The external firm requires someone to be present.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Two people are away most months. Kitchen mess comes from only three of us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Standards vary wildly. The grout gets dirty again in eleven days due to poor ventilation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The previous tenants split rooms permanently and stopped speaking by year two.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire help, the cost is 4,200 yen per hour. That is significant.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, yes. But it removes the time burden from us.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the varying standards are a problem. We need a clear definition of done.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, agreed. The grout issue means we need frequent attention, not just deep cleans.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, the cost is high, but the previous method caused social breakdown.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning towards a paid service to ensure consistency and remove the cost of my time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The time cost is too high for a fixed rota given our absences.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A paid service solves the usage imbalance. I support it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"If we pay, we need to ensure they handle the grout and ventilation issues.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I am worried about the cost, but I value our harmony more. I support the paid option.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
